type: software
title: "spikein-normalisation: when does internal-control normalisation help?"
abstract: >-
  Simulation framework and closed-form variance-component criterion for
  deciding when spike-in internal-control normalisation improves molecular
  quantification. Companion code for the manuscript "A variance-component
  criterion for deciding when internal-control normalisation improves
  molecular quantification".
